{
  "slug": "ng",
  "name": "Ng",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Angular development assistant — generate, review, test and migrate Angular apps",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**, **2 agents**, **6 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `angular-generate` (Generate Angular artifacts (components, services, pipes, directives, guards, interceptors, routes, stores)), `angular-migration` (Migrate deprecated Angular patterns to modern equivalents), `angular-performance` (Angular performance patterns — OnPush, signals, defer, lazy loading, virtual scroll), `angular-rxjs` (RxJS patterns in Angular — operators, signals interop, cleanup, and common recipes), `angular-testing` (Write Angular unit tests), `ngrx-patterns` (NgRx best practices for actions, reducers, selectors, and effects)\n- **Agents** (2): `angular-architect` (Senior Angular architect for feature design, module boundaries, state strategy, and performance architecture), `angular-reviewer` (Angular code reviewer for production readiness, security, performance, and test coverage)\n- **Commands** (6): `docs` (Generate TSDoc comments and documentation for Angular code), `generate` (Generate Angular artifacts following the opinionated project structure), `migrate` (Migrate Angular patterns to modern equivalents), `review` (Review Angular code for best practices, performance, and correctness), `store` (Scaffold a complete NgRx feature store), `test` (Generate unit tests for an Angular file)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install ng@claude-community` from `mayeedwin/angular-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
